{"id":10926,"date":"2025-08-19T08:43:49","date_gmt":"2025-08-19T15:43:49","guid":{"rendered":"https://staging.kosick.com/?p=10926"},"modified":"2026-07-06T17:56:55","modified_gmt":"2026-07-07T00:56:55","slug":"social-media-marketing-build-an-audience","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https://staging.kosick.com/social-media-marketing-build-an-audience/","title":{"rendered":"How to Build a Social Media Audience"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">To build a social media audience, you need more than posting; you need a strategy to connect with customers, tell your story, and grow a loyal following. But success doesn’t come from simply posting, it requires a strategy designed to attract, engage, and convert the right audience. For Vancouver businesses, that means knowing how to reach people locally while standing out in a competitive, fast-moving digital world.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">At Kosick Communications, we help businesses harness the full potential of social media marketing. With experience across industries including real estate, garden centres, home services, jewelry, automotive, retail, and medical, our Vancouver-based team knows how to create content and campaigns that resonate.</p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-medium-font-size\"><strong>Why Building a Social Media Audience Works</strong></h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Canadians spend nearly two hours per day on platforms like <a href=\"http://facebook.com\" data-type=\"link\" data-id=\"facebook.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\">Facebook</a>, <a href=\"http://instagram.com\" data-type=\"link\" data-id=\"instagram.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\">Instagram</a>, <a href=\"http://tikTok.com\" data-type=\"link\" data-id=\"tikTok.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\">TikTok</a>, <a href=\"http://youtube.com\" data-type=\"link\" data-id=\"youtube.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\">YouTube</a>, and <a href=\"http://linkedin.com\" data-type=\"link\" data-id=\"linkedin.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\">LinkedIn</a>. These aren’t just social networks—they’ve become discovery engines for shopping, services, and lifestyle choices. A strong presence on these platforms allows businesses to:</p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Build trust with professional, visually appealing content.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Target audiences by location, interests, and demographics.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Engage in two-way communication with customers.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Drive traffic to websites, storefronts, and events.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">For Vancouver companies, social media marketing isn’t just about broad reach; it’s about connecting with local communities in meaningful ways.</p>\n\n\n<style>.kb-row-layout-id10926_b3a5d2-b1 > .kt-row-column-wrap{align-content:start;}:where(.kb-row-layout-id10926_b3a5d2-b1 > .kt-row-column-wrap) > .wp-block-kadence-column{justify-content:start;}.kb-row-layout-id10926_b3a5d2-b1 > .kt-row-column-wrap{column-gap:var(--global-kb-gap-md, 2rem);row-gap:var(--global-kb-gap-md, 2rem);padding-top:var(--global-kb-spacing-sm, 1.5rem);padding-bottom:var(--global-kb-spacing-sm, 1.5rem);grid-template-columns:repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));}.kb-row-layout-id10926_b3a5d2-b1 > .kt-row-layout-overlay{opacity:0.30;}@media all and (max-width: 1024px){.kb-row-layout-id10926_b3a5d2-b1 > .kt-row-column-wrap{grid-template-columns:repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));}}@media all and (max-width: 767px){.kb-row-layout-id10926_b3a5d2-b1 > .kt-row-column-wrap{grid-template-columns:minmax(0, 1fr);}}</style><div class=\"kb-row-layout-wrap kb-row-layout-id10926_b3a5d2-b1 alignnone wp-block-kadence-rowlayout\"><div class=\"kt-row-column-wrap kt-has-2-columns kt-row-layout-equal kt-tab-layout-inherit kt-mobile-layout-row kt-row-valign-top\">\n<style>.kadence-column10926_81be94-54 > .kt-in