m-left-radius:0px;}.kadence-column10926_838db8-7e > .kt-inside-inner-col{column-gap:var(--global-kb-gap-sm, 1rem);}.kadence-column10926_838db8-7e > .kt-inside-inner-col{flex-direction:column;}.kadence-column10926_838db8-7e > .kt-inside-inner-col > .aligncenter{width:100%;}.kadence-column10926_838db8-7e > .kt-inside-inner-col:before{opacity:0.3;}.kadence-column10926_838db8-7e{position:relative;}@media all and (max-width: 1024px){.kadence-column10926_838db8-7e > .kt-inside-inner-col{flex-direction:column;justify-content:center;}}@media all and (max-width: 767px){.kadence-column10926_838db8-7e > .kt-inside-inner-col{flex-direction:column;justify-content:center;}}</style>\n<div class=\"wp-block-kadence-column kadence-column10926_838db8-7e\"><div class=\"kt-inside-inner-col\"><style>.kb-image10926_7a610d-fa .kb-image-has-overlay:after{opacity:0.3;}</style>\n<figure class=\"wp-block-kadence-image kb-image10926_7a610d-fa size-large\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"742\" height=\"960\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/social-media-marketing-742x960.webp\" alt=\"Social Media Marketing Vancouver\" class=\"kb-img wp-image-10861\" srcset=\"/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/social-media-marketing-742x960.webp 742w, /wp-content/uploads/2025/08/social-media-marketing-360x466.webp 360w, /wp-content/uploads/2025/08/social-media-marketing-1186x1536.webp 1186w, /wp-content/uploads/2025/08/social-media-marketing-1140x1476.webp 1140w, /wp-content/uploads/2025/08/social-media-marketing.webp 1483w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 742px) 100vw, 742px\" /></figure>\n</div></div>\n\n</div></div>\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-medium-font-size\"><strong>How to Build and Engage an Audience in Vancouver</strong></h2>\n\n\n\n<ol class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Focus on Local Storytelling</strong><br />Vancouver audiences respond to content that feels authentic and community-driven. Share behind-the-scenes stories, spotlight your role in the community, and feature local landmarks or events to make your content relatable.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Use Professional Content Creation</strong><br />Platforms like Instagram and YouTube thrive on quality. Professional photography, drone footage, cinematic videos, and even 3D renderings elevate your brand and create an impression of credibility. Whether it’s jewelry, real estate, or home renovations, polished content performs better across all channels.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Leverage Short-Form Video</strong><br />TikTok, Instagram Reels, and YouTube Shorts are the fastest-growing formats. Vancouver businesses can use these to showcase transformations, share tips, or highlight quick behind-the-scenes clips that entertain and educate.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Educate and Add Value</strong><br />Audiences reward businesses that help them learn something new. Garden centres can share planting tips on Facebook, medical clinics can post short health advice videos on YouTube, and automotive brands can provide quick maintenance tips on TikTok or Instagram Reels. Value-driven content builds trust and repeat engagement.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Engage, Don’t Just Post</strong><br />Social media is a two-way street. Respond to comments, ask questions in captions, and use Instagram Stories or Facebook polls to invite feedback. For example, a retailer could ask customers to vote on a new product style, while a real estate company could host live Q&amp;A sessions on YouTube or Facebook Live.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Pair Organic Reach with Paid Media Buying</strong><br />While organic posts are crucial for authenticity, paid campaigns ensure your best content reaches a wider audience. Our team uses Facebook Ads Manager, Instagram placements, TikTok Ads, and YouTube pre-roll to target the right demographics. Combined with media buying on traditional outlets like CTV, Sportsnet, TSN, and Global News, this creates a powerful multi-channel approach.</li>\n</ol>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-medium-font-size\"><strong>Our Experience Across Industries</strong></h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">We’ve built social media campaigns for a diverse range of industries:</p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Real Estate: Cinematic walkthroughs, renderings, and lifestyle videos to showcase new projects.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Garden Centres: Seasonal photography, tips, and product showcases that inspire engagement.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Home Services: Testimonial videos and before-and-after project content to build trust.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Jewelry: Elegant photography and short-form video reels that capture craftsmanship.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Automotive: Lifestyle content, cinematic reels, and performance-focused campaigns.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Retail: Product photography, influencer collaborations, and paid promotions that drive sales.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Medical: Educational graphics and professional video content that build credibility.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-medium-font-size\"><strong>Why Work With a Vancouver Marketing Agency</strong></h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">A Vancouver marketing agency understands the nuances of local audiences. From targeting neighborhoods in Metro Vancouver on Facebook Ads to creating TikTok content that taps into city culture, our strategies combine local knowledge with global best practices.</p>\n\n\n\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\"/>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40)\">At Kosick Communications, social media marketing is more than posting—it’s about creating meaningful connections. By combining photography, cinematography, animations, and strategic media buying across Facebook, Instagram, TikTok, YouTube, LinkedIn, and traditional media, we help businesses in Vancouver grow their audience and build lasting brand loyalty.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Ready to elevate your presence? Connect with our team today and learn how social media marketing can help your brand engage Vancouver audiences more effectively.</p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-medium-font-size\"><strong>Let’s Build What’s Next Together</strong></h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><a href=\"https://staging.kosick.com/contact/\">Let’s start a conversation</a> about where your business is headed and how we can help you get there.</p>\n\n\n<style>.kb-row-layout-id10926_93d7dd-db > .kt-row-column-wrap{align-content:start;}:where(.kb-row-layout-id10926_93d7dd-db > .kt-row-column-wrap) > .wp-block-kadence-column{justify-content:start;}.kb-row-layout-id10926_93d7dd-db > .kt-row-column-wrap{column-gap:var(--global-kb-gap-md, 2rem);row-gap:var(--global-kb-gap-md, 2rem);max-width:700px;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;padding-top:50px;padding-bottom:50px;grid-template-columns:minmax(0, 1fr);}.kb-row-layout-id10926_93d7dd-db > .kt-row-layout-overlay{opacity:0.30;}@media all and (max-width: 1024px){.kb-row-layout-id10926_93d7dd-db > .kt-row-column-wrap{grid-template-columns:minmax(0, 1fr);}}@media all and (max-width: 767px){.kb-row-layout-id10926_93d7dd-db > .kt-row-column-wrap{grid-template-columns:minmax(0, 1fr);}}</style><div class=\"kb-row-layout-wrap kb-row-layout-id10926_93d7dd-db alignfull has-theme-palette4-background-color kt-row-has-bg wp-block-kadence-rowlayout\"><div class=\"kt-row-column-wrap kt-has-1-columns kt-row-layout-equal kt-tab-layout-inherit kt-mobile-layout-row kt-row-valign-top\">\n<style>.kadence-column10926_59df2b-59 > .kt-inside-inner-col{display:flex;}.kadence-column10926_59df2b-59 > .kt-inside-inner-col,.kadence-column10926_59df2b-59 > .kt-inside-inner-col:before{border-top-left-radius:0px;border-top-right-radius:0px;border-bottom-right-radius:0px;border-bottom-left-radius:0px;}.kadence-column10926_59df2b-59 > .kt-inside-inner-col{column-gap:var(--global-kb-gap-sm, 1rem);}.kadence-column10926_59df2b-59 > .kt-inside-inner-col{flex-dir